note store/head.om: nodes/head.om of the store-reading build (run.sh units with FORGE_STORE). The
note default branch of the current repository is the default-branch field of its catalog line
note (store/repos.om put it into fabr after checking it against the branch rule of om/landrec.om and
note against record 1), so no HEAD file is read. Callers (browse brdefref, dl dldefbr) fall back to
note "main" when nshead is false, as with nodes/head.om; here that happens only without a current
note repository.
global nshb uchar 256
global nshbl ulong 1
fn nshead to bool
put nshbl 0 0
i = get fridx 0
if ge i get fan 0
ret false
end
n = get fabl i
if or eq n 0 gt n len nshb
ret false
end
o = get fabo i
for k ulong n bound 256
put nshb k get fabr add o k
end
put nshbl 0 n
ret true
end
